gametitle=Grand Theft Auto III (NTSC-U SLUS-20062 / CRC 5E115FB6)
comment=Work in progress. Adds an on-foot first-person camera using the game's overhead camera slot.
comment=Cycle past the three normal third-person camera distances to enter first person.
comment=Right-stick look, camera-relative movement, and R3 look-behind are supported.
comment=Optional vertical-look inversion is available as a separate cheat group.
comment=Fully restart the game with the main cheat disabled to completely remove the patch.

[Cheats\First Person - Overhead Slot]
author=Zeroable
description=First-person view replaces the overhead on-foot camera. Cycle past the three normal third-person distances. Keeps native eye position and right-stick look; allows camera-relative directional movement. Optional inversion settings below require this cheat. Fully restart with this cheat disabled to uninstall.
